The '''Laguna Caves''' were [[cave]]s on the [[desert]] [[planet]] of [[Tatooine]]. In the last decades of the [[Galactic Republic]], they were part of the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] [[Mos Espa podrace circuit|racetrack]].<ref name="absolutely" /> Because of a [[canyon krayt dragon]] that had taken residence there, rescue teams never dared to enter the caves. During the [[Podracing|podrace]]<ref name="DB Ratts">{{Databank|ratts-tyerell|Ratts Tyerell}}</ref> that took place in [[32 BBY]],<ref name="GA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> the [[Aleena]] [[Podracer (profession)|racer]] [[Ratts Tyerell]] crashed in the tight confines of the Laguna Caves, which [[Death|killed]] him instantly.<ref name="DB Ratts" />

